<title>USA: Global Industrial gets $27mln Chile contract.</title>
<headline>Global Industrial gets $27mln Chile contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Industrial Technologies Inc said Wednesday its Chilean subsidiary Refractarios Chilenos received a three-year $27 million contract.</p>
<p>Global said Refractarios will supply 23,580 tonnes of refractory products over three years to Chilean steel maker Compania Siderurgica Huachipato's steel mill in Talcahuano-Conception.  It added shipments will start in August.</p>
</text>
